# 3-3 BUSSEN — the bus (DESIGN §8.3): a moving platform. Hop onto the roof of the yellow bus at the stop; it drives
# off and carries Bo down the street over the road works (pits). Crouch under the low signs, hop up for the stars
# (the bus goes on under Bo while he is in the air, so start near its front). At the end: the parking lot.
# The only flags are before the stop and after the ride (the bus does not come back for Bo).
